    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="9.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:EGu">EGu</ref> 9.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif man wealdan mage, ne dyde man næfre on Sunnandæges freolse ænige forwyrhtne, ac wylde ⁊ healde, þæt se freolsdæg agan sy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If it can be so contrived, no capital offender shall ever be put to death during the feast of Sunday, but he shall be arrested and kept in custody until the festival is over.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gyf man wealdan mæge, ne dyde man næfre on Sunnandæges freolse ænige forwyrhtne, ac wylde ⁊ healde, þæt se freolsdæg agan sy.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
